/**
 * Noto Sans subsets (printable ASCII + U+20B9 rupee sign) — the bill
 * renderers embed these so the ₹ sign prints everywhere and mobile HTML +
 * desktop/web PDF use the SAME font family on every device (no reliance on
 * device-installed fonts). Font: Noto Sans, SIL Open Font License 1.1
 * (https://github.com/notofonts/noto-fonts). Regenerate with fontTools
 * subset over unicodes U+0020-007E + U+20B9 using DEFAULT subset options
 * (jsPDF's TTF parser needs the full name tables), then paste as base64.
 */
